Preview stopping remote hosting; --all also stops the local provider owner

Usage: mxr serve stop [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --all
      --dry-run
      --confirm
      --format <FORMAT>  Structured output (json or jsonl) [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help             Print help
